  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それから……\r\nさっきはごめんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010250,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "え、えっと……\r\nさっき……ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、ちょっと準備で焦ってさ\r\n霧子にきつく当たったかもしれない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "霧子はすごく気を遣って\r\n仕事をしてくれてただけなのにな……面目ない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010260,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "そ、そんな……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010270,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "わたし……あんまりいろんなことが……\r\nうまくできないので……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010280,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "今はプロデューサーさんの痛いのが\r\n治ってくれたらって……それだけです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010290,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "でも……お役に立てたなら、嬉しい……♪",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "霧子……ああ、\r\nすごく、助かったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010300,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "あ、あの……この救急箱を片付けたら、\r\nまたお手伝い、再開しますね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。よろしく頼むよ、霧子",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2008003010310,
    "speaker": "霧子",
    "text": "は、はい……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kiriko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200800301/2008003010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、せっかく霧子に手当てしてもらったんだ\r\n販売会もうまくいくようにサポートしないとな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
